(2)with the use of a narcotic or any means liable to overcome or weaken the victim's resistance;
(3)by any person having authority over the victim;
(4)by any person abusing the authority vested in him or her by his or duties;
(5)by several persons acting as perpetrators, co-perpetrators, instigators or accomplices.

