(1)against a person who is particularly vulnerable by reason of his or her age;
(2)against a pregnant woman whose pregnancy is obvious or known to the perpetrator;

(3)against a person who is particularly vulnerable by reason of illness or disability and whose state is obvious of known to the perpetrator.

