Legal entities may be found criminally responsible under Article 42 (Criminal responsibility of legal entities) for offences defined in Article 548 (Bribery of witness), Article 554 (Bribery of interpreter/translator) and Article 556 (Bribery of expert) of this Code.

Legal entities shall be punishable by a fine from twenty million to two hundred million Riels and by one or more of the following additional penalties:
